<title>SPAIN: Reuters 4th ex-Madrid cair cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 4th ex-Madrid cair cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex- Madrid Spanish peseta air cargo rates per kg for a 100 kg shipment with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>				Nov 18	  Oct 16</p>
<p>			    NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p> MAD-JFK			160	     165</p>
<p> MAD-CHI			185	     180</p>
<p> MAD-LAX			210	     200</p>
<p> MAD-MIA			200	     190</p>
<p>			    LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p> MAD-MEX			270	     275</p>
<p> MAD-BAI			450	     455</p>
<p> MAD-RIO			410	     410</p>
<p>			    MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> MAD-DUB			250	     230</p>
<p>			    FAR EAST</p>
<p> MAD-HKG			250	     240</p>
<p> MAD-TYO			360	     350</p>
<p>* The rates quoted in the report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, general sales agents and freight forwarders based at an near Madrid airport.</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
